The calibrated isometry $\iota:\mathbb C^3\to\mathbb C^5$ has columns

$$
|+\rangle=(e_0+e_4)/\sqrt2,\qquad
|-\rangle=(e_1+e_3)/\sqrt2,\qquad |2\rangle=e_2.
\tag{JG.4}
$$

Write $V=\operatorname{range}\iota$ and $\Pi=\iota\iota^\dagger$.
